---
import { discordLink } from "../../data/community";
const inviteCode = discordLink.split("/").pop();
---

---

<section
  id="home"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden pt-20"
  data-invite-code={inviteCode}
>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl px-6 text-center">
    <span
      class="inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/30 text-sm font-semibold mb-6 opacity-0 translate-y-8 animate-[fadeInUp_1s_ease-out_0.1s_forwards]"
    >
      <i class="fas fa-code mr-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Herramientas abiertas
    </span>
    <h1
      class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black mb-6 text-white tracking-tight opacity-0 translate-y-8 animate-[fadeInUp_1s_ease-out_0.3s_forwards]"
    >
      Bots y APIs <span
        class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-yellow-500"
        >Públicas</span
      >
    </h1>
    <p
      class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#b0b0b0] mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light opacity-0 translate-y-8 animate-[fadeInUp_1s_ease-out_0.6s_forwards]"
    >
      Un espacio donde compartimos los bots de Discord y las herramientas que
      vamos creando. Son de uso libre, así que si te sirven para tu servidor o
      stream, siéntete libre de usarlas.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 my-8 opacity-0 translate-y-8 animate-[fadeInUp_1s_ease-out_0.9s_forwards]"
    >
      <a
        href="#apis"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition-all text-lg cursor-pointer bg-[#f97316]/10 text-white border border-[#f97316]/50 hover:bg-[#f97316]/20 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(249,115,22,0.3)]"
        aria-label="Ver proyectos disponibles"
      >
        <i class="fas fa-rocket mr-3 text-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ver proyectos
      </a>
      <a
        href={discordLink}
        target="_blank"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition-all text-lg cursor-pointer bg-[#151515] text-white border border-[#404040] hover:bg-[#404040] hover:-translate-y-1"
        aria-label="Unirse a la comunidad de Discord"
      >
        <i class="fab fa-discord mr-3 text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i> Comunidad de
        Discord
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex justify-center gap-12 mt-12 opacity-0 translate-y-8 animate-[fadeInUp_1s_ease-out_1.2s_forwards] border-t border-[#404040] pt-10"
    >
      <div class="text-center">
        <span
          id="member-count"
          class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-1">...</span
        >
        <span
          class="text-xs text-[#808080] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold"
          >Miembros</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span
          id="online-count"
          class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#4ade80] mb-1"
          >...</span
        >
        <span
          class="text-xs text-[#808080] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold"
          >Online</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#f472b6] mb-1"
          >2+</span
        >
        <span
          class="text-xs text-[#808080] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold"
          >Bots Propios</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
